13
00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:25.320
or career path.

14
00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:27.717
But according to the dating app, Inner Circle,

15
00:00:27.717 --> 00:00:29.280
"Four out of five people say

16
00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:33.190
dating their type is not working for them."

17
00:00:33.190 --> 00:00:35.570 line:15%
Girl, wake up, it's not working.

18
00:00:35.570 --> 00:00:38.170 line:15%
So this sounds like you experts say

19
00:00:38.170 --> 00:00:40.870 line:15%
