20
00:00:40.870 --> 00:00:42.930 line:15%
Surprise yourself, try a date with someone

21
00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:46.050 line:15%
who doesn't match your usual type or your criteria,

22
00:00:46.050 --> 00:00:47.550 line:15%
just to see how it goes.

23
00:00:47.550 --> 00:00:48.890 line:15%
I love this idea.

24
00:00:48.890 --> 00:00:51.100 line:15%
I love this so much.
Because what do you have

25
00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:52.940 line:15%
to lose if you try something?
Nothing!

26
00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:54.370 line:15%
Exactly, thank you.

27
00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:57.210 line:15%
Isn't the definition of insanity

28
00:00:57.210 --> 00:00:59.570
doing the same thing over and over again,

29
00:00:59.570 --> 00:01:00.740
