"Let's drink, let's party, let's travel, let's play."

40
00:01:20.568 --> 00:01:23.240
It was more hedonistic, less sustainable.

41
00:01:23.240 --> 00:01:24.700
Oh, uh-huh, uh-huh, uh-huh.

42
00:01:24.700 --> 00:01:28.810
But I'm glad I did it 'cause now I'm so sustainable.

43
00:01:28.810 --> 00:01:30.367
Yes you are.

44
00:01:30.367 --> 00:01:32.070
And less hedonistic.
Totally.

45
00:01:32.070 --> 00:01:34.230
So the tables turn,

46
00:01:34.230 --> 00:01:37.370
I don't think we necessarily groundhog in our own life.

47
00:01:37.370 --> 00:01:41.190
I love when people know that they're capable of change

48
00:01:41.190 --> 00:01:42.780
and people are capable of change

49
00:01:42.780 --> 00:01:45.410
so anybody who wants to turn a cycle

50
00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:47.880
or break a pattern, you can.

51
00:01:47.880 --> 00:01:49.870
Absolutely, you can!
Absolutely.

52
00:01:49.870 --> 00:01:54.240
I've seen the evidence of it with my own behaviors.

53
00:01:54.240 --> 00:01:55.860
I've seen it in other people.

54
00:01:55.860 --> 00:01:57.840
So if you are groundhogging

55
